{
	"title": "Systèmes linéaires et calcul matriciel",
	"description": "Écrire un système 2 × 2 sous la forme AX = B et le résoudre avec A⁻¹ (donnée ou à calculer) : X = A⁻¹B (pièges : BA⁻¹ ou AB au lieu de A⁻¹B, x et y échangés)",
	"grades": ["T_EXP"],
	"points": ["TEXP-128", "TEXP-135"],
	"theme": "Graphes et matrices",
	"domain": "Matrices",
	"subdomain": "Systèmes linéaires",
	"level": 2,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 60,
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "On considère le système\n\n$$\\begin{cases} {{a1}}x {{a2;+}}y = {{e1}} \\\\ {{a3}}x {{a4;+}}y = {{e2}} \\end{cases}$$\n\nIl s'écrit $AX = B$ avec $A = \\begin{pmatrix}{{a1}}&{{a2}}\\\\{{a3}}&{{a4}}\\end{pmatrix}$, $X = \\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}$, $B = \\begin{pmatrix}{{e1}}\\\\{{e2}}\\end{pmatrix}$, et $A^{-1} = \\begin{pmatrix}{{a4}}&{{eval:-a2}}\\\\{{eval:-a3}}&{{a1}}\\end{pmatrix}$.\n\n$x=?$\n\n$y=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a1",
					"expression": "1..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "a2",
					"expression": "-4..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "a3",
					"expression": "-4..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "a4",
					"expression": "eval:(1+a2*a3)/a1"
				},
				{
					"name": "x",
					"expression": "-5..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "y",
					"expression": "-5..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "e1",
					"expression": "eval:a1*x+a2*y"
				},
				{
					"name": "e2",
					"expression": "eval:a3*x+a4*y"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"mod(1+a2*a3,a1) == 0",
				"a1 >= 2",
				"abs(a2) >= 2",
				"abs(a3) >= 2",
				"abs(a4) >= 2",
				"x != y"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{x}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{y}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$AX = B \\iff X = A^{-1}B$ (on multiplie à gauche par $A^{-1}$).",
					"$X = \\begin{pmatrix}{{a4}} \\times {{e1;()}} + {{eval:-a2;()}} \\times {{e2;()}} \\\\ {{eval:-a3}} \\times {{e1;()}} + {{a1}} \\times {{e2;()}}\\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix}\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{x}}}\\\\\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{y}}}\\end{pmatrix}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Résous le système\n\n$$\\begin{cases} {{a1}}x {{a2;+}}y = {{e1}} \\\\ {{a3}}x {{a4;+}}y = {{e2}} \\end{cases}$$\n\n(indication : écris-le $AX = B$ et calcule $A^{-1}$).\n\n$x=?$\n\n$y=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a1",
					"expression": "1..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "a2",
					"expression": "-4..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "a3",
					"expression": "-4..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "a4",
					"expression": "eval:(1+a2*a3)/a1"
				},
				{
					"name": "x",
					"expression": "-5..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "y",
					"expression": "-5..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "e1",
					"expression": "eval:a1*x+a2*y"
				},
				{
					"name": "e2",
					"expression": "eval:a3*x+a4*y"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"mod(1+a2*a3,a1) == 0",
				"a1 >= 2",
				"abs(a2) >= 2",
				"abs(a3) >= 2",
				"abs(a4) >= 2",
				"x != y"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{x}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{y}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$A = \\begin{pmatrix}{{a1}}&{{a2}}\\\\{{a3}}&{{a4}}\\end{pmatrix}$, $ad - bc = 1$, donc $A^{-1} = \\begin{pmatrix}{{a4}}&{{eval:-a2}}\\\\{{eval:-a3}}&{{a1}}\\end{pmatrix}$.",
					"$X = A^{-1}B$ : $x = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{x}}}$ et $y = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{y}}}$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
